        "native_id": "pxgylqtspt7m",
        "status": "investigating",
        "body": "We are investigating elevated latency and a small number of failed requests for Grafana Cloud Logs in AWS US East (VA). Some customers writing logs to this region may see delayed ingestion or occasional write errors. We are actively investigating and will share more as we learn it. Next update by 13:38 UTC.",
